  <PrimaryOccupation type="string">Gallery cleaner and, by accident, prize-winning artist</PrimaryOccupation>
  <Description type="string">Alice Wong belongs to Frameless Expressionism and works in the disused swimming pool. Asked about influences, Alice Wong said only "silence, in three coats of varnish".</Description>
